WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.864
The backbone is a frozen vision transformer.

00:00:02.944 --> 00:00:10.025
Patch tokens from several stages are aggregated at
multiple neighborhood degrees to represent defect sizes.

00:00:10.105 --> 00:00:15.512
In mutual scoring, each patch is scored by its
nearest match in every other image,

00:00:15.592 --> 00:00:20.130
and only the smallest score interval is averaged,
sharpening the gap.

00:00:20.210 --> 00:00:25.550
The image score is refined with a constrained
neighborhood graph on class tokens.
